{
  "name": "dsh-adaptive-shell",
  "version": "5.3.1",
  "private": true,
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 插件：按屏幕尺寸与比例匹配手机/平板/桌面。给输入框与会话页头补安全区（刘海、Home 指示条）、窄屏收紧留白、触摸设备放大控件，并把配色换成 Miracle 设计语言（暖白纸面/墨蓝色阶/蓝紫品牌/柔和圆角/克制阴影，暗色独立配色）。手机上完全收起 56px 图标栏（入口在会话页头）；侧栏与主会话按 Miracle 动效纪律同步位移（只动 transform、两向同时结束、reduced-motion 瞬时降级）；不动文档高度、不含任何覆盖层，所以不可能把界面锁住；桌面级窗口一条规则都不命中。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "responsive",
    "mobile",
    "layout",
    "adaptive"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation"
      ]
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/smoke.mjs"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
